{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_127_deepdrr-title\">DeepDRR</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">DeepDRR 不是纯 GAN 渲染器，而是 3D 材料分解网络、解析材料/能谱 ray tracing、学习散射和解析噪声的组合 forward model。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Physics-based X-ray fluoroscopy simulator combining CNN 3D tissue material decomposition, analytical energy-dependent Beer–Lambert ray-casting, learned Rayleigh/Compton scatter, and quantum noise.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">患者 CT、X-ray 源—探测器几何、能谱和曝光参数</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Volumetric 3D CT scan, C-arm source–detector geometry, X-ray spectrum E, and photon flux</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">含材料衰减、散射和噪声的逼真数字重建 X-ray/fluoroscopy</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Photorealistic synthetic fluoroscopy / Digitally Reconstructed Radiograph (DRR) with physical scatter and noise</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.08606\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_127_deepdrr')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_127_deepdrr')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DeepDRR original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/cd0518172231eefa4319.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_127_deepdrr\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_127_deepdrr')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_127_deepdrr\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CT volume</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CT volume</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">HU 体积与可选器械/植入物模型</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests volumetric 3d ct scan, c-arm source–detector geometry, x-ray spectrum e, and photon flux and prepares initial tensor representations (CT volume).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"HU 体积与可选器械/植入物模型\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests volumetric 3d ct scan, c-arm source–detector geometry, x-ray spectrum e, and photon flux and prepares initial tensor representations (CT volume).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"CT volume\" data-node-name-en=\"CT volume\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CT volume</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">HU 体积与可选器械/植入物模型</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests volumetric 3d ct scan, c-arm source–detector geometry, x-ray spectrum e, and photon flux and prepares initial tensor representations (CT volume).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"源、探测器、姿态、像素尺寸和 X-ray spectrum\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"成像几何与能谱\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">成像几何与能谱</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">源、探测器、姿态、像素尺寸和 X-ray spectrum</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 CT 分成空气、软组织和骨等材料概率/体积\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D material-decomposition V-Net within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"3D material-decomposition V-Net\" data-node-name-en=\"3D material-decomposition V-Net\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D material-decomposition V-Net</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 CT 分成空气、软组织和骨等材料概率/体积</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D material-decomposition V-Net within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 Beer–Lambert 衰减积分计算 primary projection 和 beam hardening\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ray tracer within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"材料与能谱感知 ray tracer\" data-node-name-en=\"ray tracer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">材料与能谱感知 ray tracer</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ray tracer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 Beer–Lambert 衰减积分计算 primary projection 和 beam hardening</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ray tracer within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 primary/相关物理量预测低频散射成分，训练靶来自 Monte Carlo\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D neural scatter estimator within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"2D neural scatter estimator\" data-node-name-en=\"2D neural scatter estimator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>2D neural scatter estimator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 primary/相关物理量预测低频散射成分，训练靶来自 Monte Carlo</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D neural scatter estimator within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在探测器域组合直接光子与散射信号\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Primary + scatter within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Primary + scatter 合成\" data-node-name-en=\"Primary + scatter\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Primary + scatter 合成</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Primary + scatter</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在探测器域组合直接光子与散射信号</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Primary + scatter within the core physics informed deep drr simulator computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 photon statistics 与电子噪声生成曝光相关随机性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies noise to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"解析噪声注入\" data-node-name-en=\"noise\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">解析噪声注入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 photon statistics 与电子噪声生成曝光相关随机性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies noise to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"供 2D/3D 配准、器械检测和导航训练使用\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces photorealistic synthetic fluoroscopy / digitally reconstructed radiograph (drr) with physical scatter and noise via Realistic DeepDRR.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Realistic DeepDRR\" data-node-name-en=\"Realistic DeepDRR\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_127_deepdrr', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Realistic DeepDRR</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">供 2D/3D 配准、器械检测和导航训练使用</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces photorealistic synthetic fluoroscopy / digitally reconstructed radiograph (drr) with physical scatter and noise via Realistic DeepDRR.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DeepDRR Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 材料感知 Beer–Lambert 投影、散射与噪声成像</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Polychromatic Beer–Lambert Material Attenuation Integral + Learned Scatter &amp; Quantum/Electronic Noise</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DeepDRR：核心公式 · 材料感知 Beer–Lambert 投影、散射与噪声成像\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"127\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"29.776259pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.682144 -69.00913 351.066711 29.776259\" width=\"351.066711pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\