"212.474643\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-114\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"215.041915\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-105\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"217.063733\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-109\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"222.721916\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-97\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"225.95101\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-114\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"228.518281\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-121\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"234.866588\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g7-184\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"243.825161\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g16-30\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"247.292156\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-115\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"250.121248\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-99\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"253.350342\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-97\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"256.579436\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-116\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"258.601254\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-116\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"260.623072\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-101\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"263.852166\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g20-114\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"269.000453\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g7-184\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"277.640217\" xlink:href=\"#m127_g16-89\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">简单线积分 DRR 与真实透视在散射、噪声和设备响应上差距大</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Naive monochrome line-integral DRRs lacked polychromatic beam hardening, Compton scatter, and quantum noise, creating a severe sim-to-real gap.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">结合 CT 材料分解、解析射线追踪与学习散射/噪声模型生成逼真 DRR</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Decompose CT voxels into air/soft-tissue/bone/metal via a 3D CNN, integrate analytical mass attenuation across energy spectra, and add CNN-estimated scatter + Poisson noise.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把物理 forward model 与深度学习散射估计结合，缩小合成到真实域差</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Hybrid physics + deep learning forward model that allows models trained purely on synthetic CT projections to transfer zero-shot to real clinical C-arm X-rays.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">为 2D/3D 配准、器械定位和术中导航生成训练数据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational simulation engine for training intraoperative 2D/3D registration, surgical tool tracking, and pelvic/spinal landmark detection.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">医学 X-ray 合成基础设施；仿真质量仍取决于扫描与设备标定</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core medical projective simulation infrastructure; fidelity still depends on CT slice thickness and accurate C-arm spectrum modeling.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">材料分解由深网络完成，但 primary attenuation 仍由解析射线追踪计算。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">用神经网络近似昂贵 Monte Carlo 的低频散射成分。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">最后按曝光物理注入噪声，使合成 X-ray 不只是无噪投影。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Decompose CT voxels into air/soft-tissue/bone/metal via a 3D CNN, integrate analytical mass attenuation across energy spectra, and add CNN-estimated scatter + Poisson noise.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Hybrid physics + deep learning forward model that allows models trained purely on synthetic CT projections to transfer zero-shot to real clinical C-arm X-rays.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Polychromatic Beer–Lambert Material Attenuation Integral + Learned Scatter &amp; Quantum/Electronic Noise.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可批量生成具有已知 3D 姿态和器械标签的 fluoroscopy，用于 2D/3D 配准与术中模型训练。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">材料网络、能谱、散射和噪声任一失配都会造成 synthetic-to-real gap，必须用真实设备逐协议验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Foundational simulation engine for training intraoperative 2D/3D registration, surgical tool tracking, and pelvic/spinal landmark detection.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Core medical projective simulation infrastructure; fidelity still depends on CT slice thickness and accurate C-arm spectrum modeling.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.08606\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>DeepDRR: A Catalyst for Machine Learning in Fluoroscopy-Guided Procedures</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/arcadelab/deepdrr\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
